(
  'AI vs Misinformation: How TrustLighthouse Uses Artificial Intelligence to Detect Fake News',
  'ai-vs-misinformation-detect-fake-news-2025',
  E'## The AI Revolution in Fact-Checking\n\nFake news spreads **6 times faster** than truth on social media. Human fact-checkers alone can''t keep up. That''s why TrustLighthouse combines the power of AI with human verification to create the most reliable fact-checking system available.\n\n### How Our AI Verification Engine Works\n\nWhen you submit a claim to TrustLighthouse, our AI engine performs multiple layers of analysis:\n\n#### 1. Source Cross-Referencing\nThe AI scans **hundreds of trusted databases** to find corroborating or contradicting evidence. It evaluates:\n- Academic journals and peer-reviewed research\n- Government databases and official statistics\n- Reputable news archives\n- Expert opinion databases\n\n#### 2. Sentiment & Bias Detection\nOur AI identifies emotional manipulation tactics commonly used in misinformation:\n- **Sensationalist language** detection\n- **Political bias** scoring\n- **Emotional trigger** identification\n- **Clickbait pattern** recognition\n\n#### 3. Source Credibility Scoring\nEvery source is rated on a 0-100 trust scale based on:\n- Historical accuracy rate\n- Editorial standards\n- Transparency of ownership\n- Correction policies\n- Peer reputation\n\n#### 4. Contradiction Detection\nThe AI automatically flags when a claim contradicts:\n- Previously verified facts\n- Scientific consensus\n- Official data sources\n- The claimant''s own previous statements\n\n### The Human + AI Advantage\n\nAI alone isn''t enough. Here''s why TrustLighthouse''s hybrid approach wins:\n\n| Capability | AI Only | Human Only | TrustLighthouse |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Speed | ⚡ Instant | 🐢 Hours/Days | ⚡ Minutes |\n| Scale | ✅ Unlimited | ❌ Limited | ✅ Unlimited |\n| Context | ❌ Weak | ✅ Strong | ✅ Strong |\n| Nuance | ❌ Misses it | ✅ Catches it | ✅ Catches it |\n| Bias | ⚠️ Can inherit | ⚠️ Has biases | ✅ Cross-checked |\n\n### Real-World Impact\n\nIn our first year of operation:\n- **50,000+ claims** analyzed\n- **94% accuracy rate** on AI-flagged misinformation\n- **Average verification time:** 3.2 minutes\n- **False positive rate:** Under 2%\n\n### What This Means for Verifiers\n\nAs a verifier on TrustLighthouse, AI is your superpower:\n\n1. **AI does the heavy lifting** — scans sources, scores credibility, flags contradictions\n2. **You provide the judgment** — context, nuance, and final verification\n3. **Together you earn** — faster verifications mean more bounties completed\n\nThe AI handles what machines do best (speed, scale, pattern recognition), while you handle what humans do best (judgment, context, critical thinking).\n\n### The Future of AI Verification\n\nWe''re building toward:\n- **Real-time misinformation detection** on social media\n- **Predictive analysis** to flag claims before they go viral\n- **Multi-language verification** covering 50+ languages\n- **Image and video deepfake detection**\n\n> "The future of truth isn''t AI replacing humans or humans ignoring AI — it''s both working together, and that''s exactly what TrustLighthouse delivers."\n\n**Ready to harness AI for truth? Start verifying today.**',
  'Discover how TrustLighthouse combines AI with human fact-checkers to detect fake news at scale. Learn about source scoring, bias detection, and why hybrid verification wins.',
  '/blog/ai-misinformation-cover.jpg',
  'technology',
  ARRAY['artificial-intelligence', 'fake-news', 'misinformation', 'ai-verification', 'fact-checking'],
  'published',
  NOW() - INTERVAL '3 days',
  'AI vs Misinformation: How AI Detects Fake News in 2025',
  'How TrustLighthouse uses AI to detect fake news. Source cross-referencing, bias detection, and credibility scoring with 94% accuracy. The future of fact-checking.',
  7,
  0
